[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    Since \( 7x \equiv 0 \pmod{7} \), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    53 \equiv 0 \pmod{7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    Therefore, \( 53 \) must be divisible by 7. The remainder when 53 is divided by 7 is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    \[
