[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    - \( n \) must be an integer, so \( 8k - 53 \) must be divisible by 7. We can write:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      8k \equiv 53 \pmod{7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    - Simplify \( 53 \mod 7 \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      53 \div 7 = 7 \text{ remainder } 4 \implies 53 \equiv 4 \pmod{7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    - So, we need:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      8k \equiv 4 \pmod{7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m    - Since \( 8 \equiv 1 \pmod{7} \), we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      k \equiv 4 \pmod{7}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m      \]
