[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m Now, we add the number of ways to form subcommittees with only Republicans and only Democrats:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
