[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m Next, isolate \( x \) by subtracting 19 from both sides:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
