[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m output:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m To find the value of \( x \) in the arithmetic mean, we start by using the formula for the arithmetic mean. The arithmetic mean of a set of numbers is the sum of the numbers divided by the count of the numbers. In this problem, the arithmetic mean of the numbers 7, 2, \( x \), and 10 is 9. There are 4 numbers in total.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m The formula for the arithmetic mean is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \text{Arithmetic Mean} = \frac{\text{Sum of the numbers}}{\text{Number of the numbers}}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m Given that the arithmetic mean is 9, we can set up the following equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 9 = \frac{7 + 2 + x + 10}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m First, simplify the sum in the numerator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 7 + 2 + 10 = 19
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m So the equation becomes:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 9 = \frac{19 + x}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m To eliminate the fraction, multiply both sides of the equation by 4:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 9 \times 4 = 19 + x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 36 = 19 + x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m Next, isolate \( x \) by subtracting 19 from both sides of the equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m 36 - 19 = x
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m x = 17
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m Thus, the value of \( x \) is \(\boxed{17}\).
