[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m ### Step 1: Calculate the number of subcommittees consisting entirely of Republicans.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m The number of ways to form a subcommittee of 5 Republicans from 8 Republicans is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1952501)[0m \[
